# generated evidence (sample artifacts are committed explicitly under docs/evidence/samples/;
# manifest.yaml/collect.py/chain.py/oscal.py/report.py are source; by-control/,
# integrity-chain.json, oscal-assessment-results.json, and report.md are all derived output but
# committed too so they're browsable on GitHub without cloning and running anything --
# integrity-chain.json specifically MUST be committed, not just generated locally:
# .github/workflows/evidence-integrity.yaml's tamper-check diffs a fresh regeneration against
# the committed copy, which is meaningless if there's no committed baseline to diff against)
docs/evidence/*
!docs/evidence/samples/
!docs/evidence/manifest.yaml
!docs/evidence/collect.py
!docs/evidence/chain.py
!docs/evidence/oscal.py
!docs/evidence/report.py
!docs/evidence/by-control/
!docs/evidence/integrity-chain.json
!docs/evidence/oscal-assessment-results.json
!docs/evidence/report.md

# secrets material — never committed in plaintext; SOPS-encrypted (*.enc.yaml) files are the exception
*.key
*.pem
age-key.txt
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
talosconfig

# local tooling
.DS_Store
*.log
.terraform/
.venv/
__pycache__/
